  "description": "This is a lightweight custom IMAP client built in C# using TcpClient and SslStream to communicate securely over SSL (default: port 993). It is designed to connect to IMAP servers such as Gmail (imap.gmail.com) and provides essential email management functionality without relying on third-party IMAP libraries.",
